/screenshots/

# Local cache of the Scryfall bulk files. `default_cards` alone is 78.8 MB and
# is re-downloadable in one command, so it is kept out of the repository and
# kept on disk - a re-ingest for fresh prices should not mean a fresh download.
/.data/

# The filled-in manifest. It names the real GitHub account, and GO-LIVE.md
# promises it is never committed; the .example stays the committed one.
/jelastic.jps
